ublk: add buffer selection and recycling for buffer pools

Add ublk_select_buf() which selects the smallest buffer that fits
blk_rq_bytes(rq) from the queue's sorted pools (ascending buf_size),
and ublk_recycle_buf() which returns a buffer to its owning pool.

Both operate on the per-queue head/tail ring with no locking needed
since pools are only accessed from the queue's single context.

